From: MasherDon <62326358+MasherDon@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 04 Nov 2026 08:52:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 111/121] llama : SiegeLadder P19 stage B step 2 -
 LLAMA_DSV4_LAYER_MAJOR_POOL=auto|N grows P11's shared pool to a whole layer
 for a layer-major call with SEG_SCHED (L030); the wave plan keeps the base 64
 slots (plan_slots) so the waves and the MMQ split stay as before; at k 1 a
 layer's P11 table is kept between its ubatches (lead's fix); L031 review
 fixes: the base pool is restored on an allocation failure, no expansion
 without P11 or twice in one P11 session, plan_slots kept until p11_leave,
 auto slot size = sum of the widest weights; off by default; 48K equal byte
 for byte in exact and default at k 1 and 4, k 1 run hit rate 97.84% against
 87.33% without the pool (SiegeLadder runs.md 4.292)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
